  "配置兜底模块": "Configure Fallback Module",
  "配置服务端邮箱机。通用配置、外部 API、SMTP 账号池各自可通过顶部开关启用，开哪个用哪个；多个开启时按顺序依次尝试，发送成功即轮换。SMTP 地址与端口会根据发件邮箱域名自动识别。": "Configure the server's mail engine. General config, external API and the SMTP account pool can each be enabled via the top switches; the enabled one is used, and when several are on they are tried in order with rotation after a success. SMTP host and port are detected automatically from the sender email domain.",
  "配置官网「部署文档」页展示的内容，保存后官网实时生效。": "Configure the content of the website's \"Deployment Guide\" page; changes go live immediately after saving.",
  "配置官网「部署文档」页展示的内容，保存后官网实时生效。未保存自定义内容时，官网展示默认初版文档。": "Configure the content of the website's \"Deployment Guide\" page; changes go live immediately after saving. Without custom content the site shows the default initial document.",
  "配置回调地址与请求模板，后台发生审核/反馈事件时自动推送通知到指定地址。": "Configure the callback URL and request templates; moderation/feedback events push notifications to the specified address automatically.",
